(474,263,$mw$082D4A7A9098347908B61C76037E699240ED757B964D832FD4F8FDBD6122604E$mw$,$mw$5a555c0a23445081eeea23f07774b130$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":263,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"خصم متجر 50% من ثمن 180، ما قيمة الخصم؟","TitleEn":"A store discounts 50% from a price of 180. Find the discount amount.","QuestionTextAr":"خصم متجر 50% من ثمن 180، ما قيمة الخصم؟","QuestionTextEn":"A store discounts 50% from a price of 180. Find the discount amount.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبلغ الخصم = السعر الأصلي × نسبة الخصم المئوية ÷ 100. السعر 180 وحدة والنسبة 50%، لذا الخصم = 180 × 50 ÷ 100 = 90 وحدة. السؤال يطلب قيمة الخصم فقط، وليس السعر بعد الخصم.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Discount amount = original price × discount percentage ÷ 100. Given 180 units and 50%, substitute: discount = 180 × 50 ÷ 100 = 90 units. The question asks for the discount amount, not the final sale price.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1041,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"90","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1042,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"91","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1043,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"93","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1044,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"88","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة المئوية إلى جزء من المئة.","En":"Convert the percentage into a fraction of one hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب الكسر الناتج في السعر الأصلي.","En":"Multiply the resulting fraction by the original price."}],"Title":{"Ar":"خصم متجر 50% من ثمن 180، ما قيمة الخصم؟","En":"A store discounts 50% from a price of 180. Find the discount amount."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"90"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{91}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{91}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"91"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{93}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{93}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"93"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{88}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{88}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"88"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"خصم متجر 50% من ثمن 180، ما قيمة الخصم؟","En":"A store discounts 50% from a price of 180. Find the discount amount."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مقدار الخصم هو النسبة المئوية من السعر الأصلي.","En":"The discount amount is the specified percentage of the original price."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\\frac{50}{100}$.","En":"Convert the rate to a fraction: $\\frac{50}{100}$."},{"Ar":"اضرب في السعر الأصلي 180 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.","En":"Multiply by the original price 180 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$90$","En":"$90$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب مقدار الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The required quantity is the discount, not the discounted price."},"FormulaLatex":"D=P\\frac{r}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$180\\times\\frac{50}{100}=90$","En":"$180\\times\\frac{50}{100}=90$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{90}{180}\\times100=50$","En":"$\\frac{90}{180}\\times100=50$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":32,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة المئوية إلى جزء من المئة.","En":"Convert the percentage into a fraction of one hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب الكسر الناتج في السعر الأصلي.","En":"Multiply the resulting fraction by the original price."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مقدار الخصم هو النسبة المئوية من السعر الأصلي.","En":"The discount amount is the specified percentage of the original price."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\\frac{50}{100}$.","En":"Convert the rate to a fraction: $\\frac{50}{100}$."},{"Ar":"اضرب في السعر الأصلي 180 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.","En":"Multiply by the original price 180 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$90$","En":"$90$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب مقدار الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The required quantity is the discount, not the discounted price."},"FormulaLatex":"D=P\\frac{r}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$180\\times\\frac{50}{100}=90$","En":"$180\\times\\frac{50}{100}=90$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{90}{180}\\times100=50$","En":"$\\frac{90}{180}\\times100=50$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{91}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{91}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{93}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{93}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{88}{180}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 50%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{88}{180}\\times100\\%$, not the required 50%."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مقدار الخصم هو النسبة المئوية من السعر الأصلي.

$D=P\frac{r}{100}$

1. حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\frac{50}{100}$.

2. اضرب في السعر الأصلي 180 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.

$180\times\frac{50}{100}=90$

$90$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{90}{180}\times100=50$

المطلوب مقدار الخصم لا السعر بعد الخصم.$mw$,$mw$The discount amount is the specified percentage of the original price.

$D=P\frac{r}{100}$

1. Convert the rate to a fraction: $\frac{50}{100}$.

2. Multiply by the original price 180 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price.

$180\times\frac{50}{100}=90$

$90$ Currency units

$\frac{90}{180}\times100=50$

The required quantity is the discount, not the discounted price.$mw$),
(475,264,$mw$8F1B34EE7DA1E0F39F2EB25746C754093E1CA1AB60E6426CBB4BE781EC6CB454$mw$,$mw$c4b9ef580f12dcb5583400fe709b4d5c$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":264,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 6 كم. كم يمثل 7 سم؟","TitleEn":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 6 km. What distance is 7 cm?","QuestionTextAr":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 6 كم. كم يمثل 7 سم؟","QuestionTextEn":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 6 km. What distance is 7 cm?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: المسافة الحقيقية = المسافة على الخريطة × قيمة مقياس الرسم لكل سنتيمتر. كل 1 سم يمثل 6 كم، والمسافة المرسومة 7 سم. بالتعويض: 7 × 6 = 42 كيلومتراً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Actual distance = map distance × real distance represented by one centimetre. Each map centimetre means 6 km, and the measured map distance is 7 cm. Hence 7 × 6 = 42 km.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1045,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"43","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1046,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"45","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1047,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"40","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1048,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"42","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل المسافة الحقيقية التي يمثلها سنتيمتر واحد.","En":"Use the real distance represented by one centimeter."},{"Ar":"كرر هذه المسافة بعدد السنتيمترات المعطى.","En":"Scale that distance by the given number of centimeters."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 6 كم. كم يمثل 7 سم؟","En":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 6 km. What distance is 7 cm?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{43}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{43}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"43"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{45}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{45}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"45"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{40}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{40}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"40"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"42"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 6 كم. كم يمثل 7 سم؟","En":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 6 km. What distance is 7 cm?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المسافات الحقيقية تتناسب مع مسافات الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.","En":"Real distances are proportional to map distances at a fixed scale."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كم","En":"km"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 6 كم.","En":"Find the actual distance per centimeter: 6 km."},{"Ar":"اضربها في طول الخريطة 7 سم: $6\\times7=42$.","En":"Multiply by the map length 7 cm: $6\\times7=42$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$42$","En":"$42$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين وحدات الخريطة والمسافة الحقيقية.","En":"Do not confuse map and real distance units."},"FormulaLatex":"D=\\frac{d}{d_0}D_0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{6}{1}\\times7=42$","En":"$\\frac{6}{1}\\times7=42$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{42}{7}=\\frac{6}{1}$","En":"$\\frac{42}{7}=\\frac{6}{1}$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":33,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل المسافة الحقيقية التي يمثلها سنتيمتر واحد.","En":"Use the real distance represented by one centimeter."},{"Ar":"كرر هذه المسافة بعدد السنتيمترات المعطى.","En":"Scale that distance by the given number of centimeters."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المسافات الحقيقية تتناسب مع مسافات الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.","En":"Real distances are proportional to map distances at a fixed scale."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كم","En":"km"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 6 كم.","En":"Find the actual distance per centimeter: 6 km."},{"Ar":"اضربها في طول الخريطة 7 سم: $6\\times7=42$.","En":"Multiply by the map length 7 cm: $6\\times7=42$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$42$","En":"$42$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين وحدات الخريطة والمسافة الحقيقية.","En":"Do not confuse map and real distance units."},"FormulaLatex":"D=\\frac{d}{d_0}D_0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{6}{1}\\times7=42$","En":"$\\frac{6}{1}\\times7=42$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{42}{7}=\\frac{6}{1}$","En":"$\\frac{42}{7}=\\frac{6}{1}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{43}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{43}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{45}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{45}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{40}{7}$ كم لكل سم، لا 6؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{40}{7}$ km per cm, not 6; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المسافات الحقيقية تتناسب مع مسافات الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.

$D=\frac{d}{d_0}D_0$

1. حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 6 كم.

2. اضربها في طول الخريطة 7 سم: $6\times7=42$.

$\frac{6}{1}\times7=42$

$42$ كم

$\frac{42}{7}=\frac{6}{1}$

لا تخلط بين وحدات الخريطة والمسافة الحقيقية.$mw$,$mw$Real distances are proportional to map distances at a fixed scale.

$D=\frac{d}{d_0}D_0$

1. Find the actual distance per centimeter: 6 km.

2. Multiply by the map length 7 cm: $6\times7=42$.

$\frac{6}{1}\times7=42$

$42$ km

$\frac{42}{7}=\frac{6}{1}$

Do not confuse map and real distance units.$mw$),
(476,265,$mw$5F3ECD3CE2515982AB3CCE2A54BBC622759EBB84B92964C48B959CF1A97A0957$mw$,$mw$4502ea8857be562fb3d254c32d2fad2a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":265,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إذا ارتفع سعر 120 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","TitleEn":"If 120 increases by 25%, what is the new price?","QuestionTextAr":"إذا ارتفع سعر 120 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","QuestionTextEn":"If 120 increases by 25%, what is the new price?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: القيمة الجديدة بعد زيادة نسبتها 25% = القيمة الأصلية + (القيمة الأصلية × 25 ÷ 100). في هذه المسألة الأصل 120؛ مقدار الزيادة = 120 × 25 ÷ 100 = 30. إذن القيمة الجديدة = 120 + 30 = 150.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: New value after a 25% increase = original value + original × 25/100. Starting at 120, compute the increase 120 × 25/100 = 30. Add it to the original: 120 + 30 = 150.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1049,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"153","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1050,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"148","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1051,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"150","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1052,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"151","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ميّز مقدار الزيادة عن السعر النهائي.","En":"Distinguish the increase from the final price."},{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة كنسبة من السعر الأصلي ثم أضفها إليه.","En":"Find the increase as a percentage of the original price, then add it."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا ارتفع سعر 120 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","En":"If 120 increases by 25%, what is the new price?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 33، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 33, but the required increase is 30."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"153"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 28، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 28, but the required increase is 30."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"148"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"150"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 31، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 31, but the required increase is 30."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"151"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا ارتفع سعر 120 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","En":"If 120 increases by 25%, what is the new price?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.","En":"The new price equals the original price plus the increase."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة: $120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=30$.","En":"Calculate the increase: $120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=30$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $120+30=150$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $120+30=150$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$150$","En":"$150$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$120+120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$","En":"$120+120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{150-120}{120}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{150-120}{120}\\times100=25$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":34,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ميّز مقدار الزيادة عن السعر النهائي.","En":"Distinguish the increase from the final price."},{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة كنسبة من السعر الأصلي ثم أضفها إليه.","En":"Find the increase as a percentage of the original price, then add it."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.","En":"The new price equals the original price plus the increase."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة: $120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=30$.","En":"Calculate the increase: $120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=30$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $120+30=150$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $120+30=150$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$150$","En":"$150$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$120+120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$","En":"$120+120\\times\\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{150-120}{120}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{150-120}{120}\\times100=25$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 33، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 33, but the required increase is 30."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 28، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 28, but the required increase is 30."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 31، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 30.","En":"This price differs from the original by 31, but the required increase is 30."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. احسب الزيادة: $120\times\frac{25}{100}=30$.

2. أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $120+30=150$.

$120+120\times\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$

$150$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{150-120}{120}\times100=25$

لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.$mw$,$mw$The new price equals the original price plus the increase.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. Calculate the increase: $120\times\frac{25}{100}=30$.

2. Add the increase to the original price: $120+30=150$.

$120+120\times\frac{25}{100}=120+30=150$

$150$ Currency units

$\frac{150-120}{120}\times100=25$

